## Deliverable Output Format Guide

| Deliverable | Format | Target Length |
|-------------|--------|---------------|
| Landing page (paid traffic) | HTML (single file) | 5 sections |
| Landing page (full product) | HTML (single file) | 8–10 sections |
| Paid ad campaign | React artifact with platform tabs | Per platform: audience + creative + KPIs |
| Email sequence | React artifact with per-email preview | 3–5 emails |
| Campaign budget | React artifact with tier toggle | 3 tiers + ramp + ROI |
