| One-pager | Markdown or HTML | Single page |
| Cold email | Plain text with subject + preheader | Under 200 words |
| LinkedIn post | Plain text | Under 250 words |
| Ad copy set | Structured text per format | Per format specs above |
| Sales pitch | Script format with stage markers | 60–90 seconds spoken |

